# Worker: Case Workspace & Review

## Goal (Master-aligned)

Persist and resume investigator work across **Intake → Compare → Report**: case CRUD, review status, evidence/process builders, and export pack — so the editable IR and DOCX stay first-class outcomes without owning allegation/quote authority.

## Role boundary

| Owns | Does not own |
|------|----------------|
| Cases API / `case_store`, Cases & Case Assist UI | Allegation body, statute quotes, IR section wording → **IR Drafting** |
| Status workflow, save/resume contracts | Stepper chrome / WAC select UX → **Intake UX** |
| Export pack wiring from Report step | PII detect/redact → **Privacy**; auth/roles → **Identity Admin** |
| ReviewStep persistence hooks (status, pack) | PDF corpus / ranking → **Corpus** |

Shared UI files (`ReviewStep`, `InvestigationReportEditor`): edit only workspace/status/export seams; leave IR content generation and quote integrity to IR Drafting.

## Invariants

1. Status path stays coherent: `draft` → `in_review` → `final`
2. Save/resume/export must not break Intake → Compare → Report
3. Never weaken PII gates or auth/permission checks when adding case fields
4. Case payload stores investigator-approved selections and draft IR; it is **not** statute authority — quotes/subsections remain PDF-backed via IR Drafting
5. Human-editable draft status stays visible; do not auto-promote to `final` without explicit investigator action

## Anti-goals

- Invent or rewrite allegation/quote/IR section text as if authoritative
- Reintroduce analyzer-first / dashboard-first case UX as the default path
- Bypass Privacy or Identity checks for “easier” persist/export
- Treat example DOCX or LLM free-text as legal authority when shaping export metadata

## Success criteria

- Case create / update / list / resume restores stepper position and IR editor state
- Status transitions are explicit and reversible only where product rules allow
- Export pack remains usable from Report step without dropping required case fields
- PII/auth contracts on save and export paths remain intact

## Escalation map

| Signal | Escalate to |
|--------|-------------|
| Allegation wording, quotes, DOCX body, IR sections | IR Drafting |
| Stepper labels, WAC select, Compare chrome, rails | Intake UX |
| Category 3/4 / redact-before-persist | Privacy |
| Login, roles, who can finalize/export | Identity Admin |
| Wrong subsection ranking in resumed case context | Corpus (+ Eval) |

Return the standard handoff block from `AGENTS.md`.
